 *
 * Steps:
 * 1. Authenticate as admin using POST /erpHrm/auth/admin/join
 * 2. Create a new project using POST /erpHrm/admin/projects
 * 3. Call PATCH /erpHrm/admin/projects/{projectId}/members with empty request body
