  /**
   * Retrieve a specific role by its unique identifier.
   *
   * This endpoint returns detailed information about a single role within an organization. The response includes the role's name, whether it is a built-in role (Owner, Manager, or Employee), and timestamps for creation and last update. Built-in roles are protected system roles that cannot be modified or deleted, while custom roles can be managed by organization owners.
   *
   * The role is scoped to its parent organization, ensuring proper data isolation between organizations. Each organization maintains its own independent set of roles. Only roles belonging to the authenticated user's current organization context are accessible.
